---
layout: page.njk
title: "Press kit"
description: "Description, facts, logo, screenshots, colours and contact for writing about Sossoldi."
lead: "Everything needed to write about Sossoldi: description, facts, logo, screenshots and colours."
ogKind: press
---
<p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/assets/press/sossoldi-press-kit.zip" download>{{ ui.en.press.download }}</a></p>

<h2>{{ ui.en.press.boilerplateTitle }}</h2>
<p class="lead">{{ ui.en.press.boilerplateNote }}</p>
<blockquote>
  <p>Sossoldi is a free and open source wealth management app for iOS and Android. It tracks accounts, investments, budgets and recurring payments, and turns them into one number: your net worth. Everything is stored on the device — there is no account to create, no subscription and no Sossoldi server. Built with Flutter and released under the MIT licence, Sossoldi is developed in the open by a community of contributors, with a public roadmap and public discussions. The app is available on the App Store, Google Play and F-Droid.</p>
</blockquote>

<h2>{{ ui.en.press.factsTitle }}</h2>
<table class="facts">
  <tbody>
    <tr><th>{{ ui.en.press.facts.name }}</th><td>Sossoldi</td></tr>
    <tr><th>{{ ui.en.press.facts.what }}</th><td>Wealth management, personal finance and net worth tracking app</td></tr>
    <tr><th>{{ ui.en.press.facts.licence }}</th><td><a href="{{ site.license.url }}" rel="noopener">MIT</a></td></tr>
    <tr><th>{{ ui.en.press.facts.platforms }}</th><td>iOS (App Store), Android (Google Play, F-Droid)</td></tr>
    <tr><th>{{ ui.en.press.facts.languages }}</th><td>English; Italian and Portuguese in progress</td></tr>
    <tr><th>{{ ui.en.press.facts.since }}</th><td>0.1.0-beta, 4 December 2024 · 1.0.0, 20 August 2026</td></tr>
    <tr><th>{{ ui.en.press.facts.price }}</th><td>Free, no paid tier, no advertising</td></tr>
    <tr><th>{{ ui.en.press.facts.repo }}</th><td><a href="{{ site.repo }}" rel="noopener">github.com/RIP-Comm/sossoldi</a></td></tr>
  </tbody>
</table>

<h2>{{ ui.en.press.assetsTitle }}</h2>
<p>{{ ui.en.press.assetsLead }}</p>
<div class="asset-grid">
  <a class="asset" href="/assets/img/sossoldi-icon.png" download>
    <img src="/assets/img/sossoldi-icon.png" alt="Sossoldi app icon" width="96" height="96">
    App icon <span>PNG · 512×512</span>
  </a>
  <a class="asset" href="/assets/docs/sossoldi_project_cover.jpg" download>
    <img src="/assets/docs/sossoldi_project_cover.jpg" alt="Sossoldi project cover" width="180" height="63">
    Project cover <span>JPG · 4944×1720</span>
  </a>
  {% for i in range(1, 6) %}
  <a class="asset" href="/assets/img/screens/0{{ i }}.png" download>
    <img src="/assets/img/screens/0{{ i }}.png" alt="Sossoldi screenshot {{ i }}" width="90" height="193" loading="lazy">
    Screenshot 0{{ i }} <span>PNG · 671×1440</span>
  </a>
  {% endfor %}
</div>

<h2>{{ ui.en.press.paletteTitle }}</h2>
<div class="palette">
  {% for color in tokens.colors %}
  <div class="swatch">
    <div class="swatch-color" style="background: {{ color.hex }}"></div>
    <div class="swatch-meta"><strong>{{ color.label }}</strong>{{ color.hex }}</div>
  </div>
  {% endfor %}
</div>

<h2>{{ ui.en.press.typeTitle }}</h2>
<p>Nunito Sans, weights 300–900. The app and this website share the same typeface; the wordmark is set in Nunito Sans Black.</p>

<h2>{{ ui.en.press.contactTitle }}</h2>
<p>{{ ui.en.press.contactNote }} <a href="mailto:{{ site.contacts.press }}">{{ site.contacts.press }}</a></p>
